WEBVTT

NOTE Existing silent dialogue reading windows; not STT. Full picture/audio edit 121.7 seconds.

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.700
<v NEMESIA>I was quite taken with that thrilling revenge of yours. A masterpiece.

2
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.300
<v NEMESIA>Even after all the blood you have spilled, goodness still lingers within you.

3
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.833
<v NEMESIA>You have not forgotten whom you must save… have you?

4
00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:18.933
<v NEMESIA>They are still waiting for you.

5
00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:21.400
<v NEMESIA>Make haste. Before it is too late.

6
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:31.433
<v NEMESIA>So the sight of that child's rocking horse brings even a dead man to his senses.

7
00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:37.700
<v NEMESIA>Very well. Escape this place. I will personally help you.

8
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.967
<v NEMESIA>Diroy and Hector will guide you.

9
00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:42.667
<v NEMESIA>Until we meet again, dead one.

10
00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:46.033
<v DIROY>Don't be alarmed. Let's introduce ourselves. I'm Diroy.

11
00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:50.100
<v HECTOR>I'm Hector. Think of us as a blessing from the goddess.

12
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:53.067
<v HECTOR>We need to get out of here too.

13
00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:55.500
<v DIROY>Demons are beings made of malice.

14
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.100
<v DIROY>They instinctively attack goodness.

15
00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.667
<v HECTOR>But you're different. Your goodness is strong.

16
00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:04.467
<v HECTOR>Your malice has only erupted for a while. That outburst will fade soon.

17
00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:08.833
<v DIROY>So demons will catch your scent and come swarming toward you.

18
00:01:08.833 --> 00:01:13.833
<v DIROY>The goddess has granted you armaments. Take them.

19
00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:17.867
<v HECTOR>A projection sent by the goddess. A soul from the battlefield.

20
00:01:17.867 --> 00:01:21.533
<v HECTOR>It will dwell in the crossbow and fight alongside you.

21
00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:28.133
<v DIROY>Put on that malice band too. It will steady your mind

22
00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:30.733
<v DIROY>before the unleashed malice drives you mad.

23
00:01:35.233 --> 00:01:39.933
<v HECTOR>This human passed out again. How long has he gone without sleep?

24
00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:45.300
<v DIROY>Looks like he spent days without food or sleep, thinking of nothing but revenge.

25
00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:48.667
<v DIROY>Leave him like this and he'll be eaten.

26
00:01:48.667 --> 00:01:53.700
<v HECTOR>We need to wake him, even if we have to feed him malice.

27
00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:56.200
<v DIROY>...
